              buzz_id: null,
              country: "US",
              description:
                'Going meatless? No big deal: with our set of tofu-forward recipes, you won\'t miss the meat at ALL, we promise. Our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/tofu-tenders">tofu tenders</a> are great to serve at your next party or gathering, and these flavorful <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/tofu-tacos">tofu tacos</a> are protein-packed and quite delicious. Oh, and our Chinese-style <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/chinese-takeout-style-tofu-and-broccoli">tofu and broccoli</a> brings you the flavor of takeout without wiping your wallet clean. It\'s time to stock up on some tofu already!',
