                "Let's talk about comfort foods! In our opinion, all foods which remind us of home are one of the most comforting foods in the world. We've curated a list of recipes for when you are missing home or your mom's cooking. Try <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/easy-juicy-chicken-marsala\">Chicken Marsala</a> or a <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/honey-mustard-glazed-ham\">honey mustard glazed ham</a> for when you're reminiscing about having dinner with your loved ones. Believe it or not, these recipes will make your moments special and give you the warmth you need!",
