              description:
                'Beef is one of the most popular meats around the world. It’s also an excellent source of protein.\nIn fact, it contains more protein than chicken or fish! You don\'t have to be a chef to make these easy beef recipes, they\'re quick and delicious! Try some of our favorite beef recipes today,\nfrom <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/chili-cheese-burger-bowls"> chili-cheese-burger-bowls </a> to \n<a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/beef-wellington-for-two"> beef-wellington </a> ! What are you waiting for? Start cooking!',
