              description:
                'There are few kitchen appliances more magical than the slow cooker. You can make so many exciting meals with it like a <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/slow-cooker-pot-roast">veggie-loaded pot roast</a>, <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/slow-cooker-beef-and-broccoli">beef and broccoli with rice</a>, or <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/slow-cooker-chicken-teriyaki">saucy teriyaki chicken</a>. Cooking for a crowd over the weekend?  Cook up a rack of these <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/slow-cooker-pineapple-baby-back-ribs">pineapple baby back ribs</a> for your next Sunday get together! It\'s time to pull out your slow cooker and put it to use over and over again. ',
