              slug: "burger-recipes-that-will-change-your-life",
              country: "US",
              is_shoppable: false,
              description:
                'What\'s not to love about burgers? Whether at a BBQ cookout or for a quick weeknight meal, there\'s nothing more satisfying than a juicy burger, especially when it pushes the envelope like our grilled pineapple loaded <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/pina-colada-burger">Piña Colada burger</a> or the decadent <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/mac-and-cheese-bun-burgers">mac and cheese bun burger</a>. You can also travel East with the Japanese-style <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/japanese-style-fried-chicken-rice-burger">Fried Chicken burger</a>. And our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/feta-stuffed-falafel-burgers">feta-stuffed falafel burgers</a> are a hit with vegetarians and non-vegetarians alike. Don\'t believe us? Try them for yourself. ',
