              canonical_id: "compilation:3085",
              promotion: "full",
              description:
                'To all the burger lovers out there, look no further! We have the most juicy and indulgent burger recipes you can share with your burger buddy! If you prefer keeping things simple, then check out our classic Homemade Massive Burger. And if you think you can take up a good challenge, then this <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/mac-and-cheese-bun-burgers">Mac N Cheese Bun Burger</a> will BLOW YOUR MIND. Say YES to this Burgermania to which even Inspector Clouseau was not immune!',
